        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Currently mild folliculitis, not significantly limiting capacity to work as an electrician; otherwise medically fit for usual duties. Hot work conditions and limited laundry may predispose to minor recurrent skin infections but are not a major disability."
